              "en": "I sold so many bracelets yesterday!"
            },
            {
              "es": "No te imaginas ==la de== vueltas ==que== di para encontrar tu casa.",
              "en": "You can't imagine how many times I went around looking for your house."
            },
            {
              "es": "¡==La cantidad de== gente ==que== vino!",
